<%# Article-history pilot: the article's identifier on a line of its own (HistoryPilotHelper#history_identifier), where
    its wording does not show its number: before a comparison's words, and alone on an archive date with no wording (a
    gap). It is the button that opens the article's menu (article_copy_menu_controller.js makes it one), so History
    and the copies stay at hand (Sol 2026-11-21 10:09:36Z: a visible, keyboard-operable identifier outside the diff).
    Locals: identifier. %>
<p class="not-prose mb-1" data-history-identifier><span class="article-number not-prose cursor-pointer"><%= identifier %></span></p>
